ere; create my color styles maybe (nice-to-have; skip paint styles, use constants in code).\n2. Build shared components: CategoryChip, FavButton, AddButton, ProductCardLarge, ProductCardSmall, BasketRow, Stepper, HeaderBack, SheetHandle, StepDone/Current/Pending, PrimaryButton (clone), SecondaryButton (outline), TextFieldFilled.\n3. Build frames 01–03 (Splash, Welcome, Name).\n4. Build frame 04 Home.\n5. Build frames 05, 06.\n6. Build frames 07, 08.\n7. Build frames 09, 10.\n8. Wire prototype connections.\n9. Screenshot all, fix issues.\n\nLayout coordinates in workspace: put components section at (0,0). Frames row 1 at y=1200: x = 0, 475, 950, 1425, 1900. Row 2 at y=2200: same x. Spacing 100.\n\nLet me define the design constants:\n\n```\nPRIMARY = {r:1, g:0.643, b:0.318}  // #FFA451\nPRIMARY_DARK = #F5793B or gradient #FFA451→#FF8125\nINK = #27214D (deep navy-purple) for headings\nBODY = #554E6F or #6E6A87\nMUTED = #A0A0B5\nFAINT = #C2BDBD (field placeholder)\nBG = #FFFFFF\nBG_SOFT = #F7F5F0? hmm. Let me use #FAF8F5 warm? The fruit salad palette is orange/warm. Warm neutral: #FFF7F0? Let me pick neutral surface #FFFFFF, page bg white, soft section bg #F6F3EF? Keep consistent: \n  - textInk #27214D\n  - textBody #6C6984\n  - textMuted #A8A3BC\n  - line #F0EEF4\n  - chipBg #F6F4F0 (light warm gray)\n  - success #3BB77E\n  - shadow rgba(39,33,77,0.08)\n```\n\nActually for the category chip selected: PRIMARY bg, white text; unselected: white bg, #C2BDBD text, subtle border #F0EEF4 or soft shadow.\n\nIngredient chips on product page: light bg #FFF3E7 (primary tint) with ink text? Use #FFF4EA with text #27214D.\n\nSheet: white, radius 24 top corners, dimmed basket behind (add #27214D 40% overlay over baked basket copy).\n\nNow, structure for 07/08: full frame 375×812:\n- Base: copy of basket content (static, no instances needed — build simplified replica of 06 frame contents; better: clone frame 06 after building it, then add overlay + sheet). That guarantees visual con