ction title — categories chips imply. Skip label, cards y=232..~390 (h≈158); \"Recommended Combo\" y≈408; cards 440..640; home indicator 778. Fits with room. Card height: pad8 + img87 + 6 + name(2 lines ~32) + 4 + price/add 24 + pad8 = 169. y 232..401. Recommended title 417, cards 443..643 (h=200). Good, breathing room to 778.\n\nLet me finalize compact card: w105: inner pad 9; img w87 h87 x9 y9; fav circle 22 at (9+87-22-3=71? put top-right overlapping image corner: x= image right - 19, y=6)... simpler: fav at x=87-22+9-0 → let me place fav circle at (73, 6)? Overlap outside image slightly. Eh — place inside image top-right with 4px inset: x = 9+87-22-4 = 70, y=13. Add shadow to circle.\nname: y=102, w=87, center, 12 SemiBold, min height 32 (auto).\nprice row y=136: price text left at x=9, add btn at x=9+87-20=76, w20 h20. Height total: 9+87+6+32+2+20+9 = 165.\n\nRecommended card w163 h~200: pad 8; img 147×110 y8; fav 24 at inset; name y=124 (13 SemiBold, 1-2 lines, w147 center); price row y≈152: price Bold 14 PRIMARY at x8; add btn 26 circle at x=147-26+8=129, y=150. h= 8+110+4+18+4+26+8=178? Let me compute: 8+110=118; name y122 h20 →142; price row y150 h26 → 176 +8 = 184. Set h=184.\n\nInstances: these are components — I'll create master \"FH / Card · Combo L\" (compact) and \"FH / Card · Combo M\"? Reuse with overrides for name/price/image. Instance overrides for image fills: instance.children find rectangle and set fills — allowed on instances (override). \n\nCard structure (master):\n```\nFrame (auto? no — absolute) 105×165 white r16 shadow clips false\n  rect? use frame bg fill instead: Frame fill white, r16, effect shadow.\n  child: imgRect 87×87 r12 image fill (placeholder Salad_Quinoa on master)\n  fav: frame 22×22 white r11 shadow, heart icon inside (Icon_Heart instance 12×11 tinted PRIMARY? original heart icon — white component fill w/ children; recolor to #FF6B57? favourite toggle: unselected = white circle + outlined heart muted? We have Icon_Heart (fi