Tropical (2:23 fills), name \"Tropical fruit salad\", price \"₦10,000\".\n  - card3 Melon: photo→Salad_Melon (2:26), name \"Melon fruit salad\", \"₦10,000\".\n- \"Recommended Combo\" Bold 16 INK at (20, 480).\n- Recommended cards y=512: Card M instances at x=20 (Honey lime — master default) and x=192 (Berry mango: photo 2:17, name \"Berry mango combo\", price \"₦8,000\").\n- Home indicator (0,778).\n\nPhoto override: `cardInst.findOne(n => n.name === \"photo\").fills = figma.getNodeById(\"2:23\").fills;` — fills of the media COMPONENT (image paint). Should work: getComponent().fills — reading fills of the master component 2:23 returns its ImagePaint. Assign array.\n\nName/price override: find text nodes by name \"name\"/\"price\" and set characters.\n\nCard heights: S=168 → y 288..456. Recommended title y=480. Cards M y=512..698. Hmm 698 close to home indicator 778 — fine. Wait, is that too low? 512+186=698, then 80px gap to 778. Good.\n\nActually let me double check greeting line: brief copy \"Hello Tony, What fruit salad combo do you want today?\" — I render two text nodes: \"Hello Tony,\" and \"What fruit salad combo do you want today?\" ✓.\n\nBasket entry: link → 06_Basket (wire later). Quinoa card → 05.\n\nMenu icon: 22×11 → place 24 wide.\n\nNow write script 4.","signature":"4e891bb442af46af9f65038c"}],"id":"15bf26d1-89d9-48c6-b0c7-b8ea92ca5432","model":"glm-5.3-flash","role":"assistant","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"type":"message","usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"2dda6b51-cf28-47fc-8f32-0dff4e440494","uuid":"3da64463-0bb1-4d5d-a61e-2391decc11c8","timestamp":"2026-10-31T05:17:35.139Z","thinking_duration_ms":22674}
