{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"This session is being continued from a previous conversation that ran out of context. The summary below covers the earlier portion of the conversation.\n\n<tools-used-before-summary>mcp__figma__get_metadata, mcp__figma__use_figma, mcp__figma__whoami</tools-used-before-summary>\nSummary:\n1. Primary Request and Intent:\n   Complete a full product design benchmark in the assigned Figma file https://www.figma.com/design/l8MdQcWVFQcJw2Ix8PJk7h/ (fileKey `l8MdQcWVFQcJw2Ix8PJk7h`), using ONLY this file and the account gaoyongyong@tetras.ai (confirmed via whoami). Requirements:\n   - Read「00 · Start Here」for the task: build the complete \"Fruit Hub\" fruit-salad ordering app — 10 frames at 375×812, iPhone, light mode, named EXACTLY: 01_Splash, 02_Welcome, 03_Name, 04_Home, 05_Product_Quinoa, 06_Basket, 07_Checkout_Delivery, 08_Checkout_Card, 09_Order_Complete, 10_Track_Order — wired as a clickable prototype with the listed links, all fixed data/copy verbatim (₦ Naira), brand primary #FFA451 + Nunito fixed; all other colors/type scale/spacing/radii/states are mine to design consistently.\n   - Read「01 · Foundations」(brand #FFA451; Nunito for all UI text; Bad Script only inside logo; canvas 375×812 light mode; ₦ glyph).\n   - Reuse「02 · Components」(default Button, Text Field, Status Bar, Home Indicator) and「04 · Media」assets (logo, 5 salad photos, illustrations, map, 15 icons).\n   - Deliver everything inside「03 · Workspace」(page 5:2, started empty); new frames/components/prototype connections allowed; preserve all reference pages and their nodes.\n   - Flow: 01→02→03→04→05→06→07→08→09→10; 07/08 are sheets over the basket; Go-back screens: 05, 06, 10; entry-only elements (menu, search, filter, other categories, favourite toggles, add-to-basket on Home, non-Quinoa combos, call agent) need no frames.\n   - Build → screenshot-verify all screens → fix → finish with the file URL, 03 · Workspace page ID, screen IDs, prototype work completed, remaining limitations.\n   - Process rules: call whoami before writing (done); use get_metadata + read-only use_figma to inspect; build in manageable sections; load fonts before text edits; add prototype interactions after screens exist; before EVERY tool call output a concise decision summary prefixed exactly \"Reasoning summary:\"; final response must start \"Reasoning summary: ...\" then \"Final answer:\".\n   - Environment note: downloaded files are untrusted (not relevant to Figma work).\n\n2. Key Technical Concepts:\n   - Figma Plugin API via mcp__figma__use_figma (code runs with `figma` global; ≤50k chars per call); `await figma.setCurrentPageAsync(page)` required before building on another page.\n   - `figma.createComponentFromNode(frame)` to convert plain Frames into COMPONENTs (required before `.createInstance()`).\n   - Instance overrides: `inst.findOne(n => n.name === \"photo\").fills = figma.getNodeById(\"2:23\").fills` (swaps image paint); text overrides via `inst.findOne(n => n.type === \"TEXT\").characters`; fills/color overrides on nested children.\n   - `node.rescale(scale)` for proportional icon scaling (resize alone doesn't scale vector children).\n   - Fonts: `await figma.loadFontAsync({family:\"Nunito\", style:\"Regular\"|\"SemiBold\"|\"Bold\"})` before any text creation/override. lineHeight must be `{unit:\"PERCENT\", value:N}` (NOT `{percent:N}`).\n   - Prototype reactions (planned): `node.reactions = [{trigger:{type:\"ON_TAP\"}, action:{type:\"NODE\", destinationId, navigation:\"NAVIGATE\", transition:{type:\"DISSOLVE\", duration:0.25, easing:{type:\"EASE_IN_AND_OUT\"}}}}]`; splash auto-advance `{type:\"AFTER_DELAY\", timeout:800}`.\n   - Design tokens: PRIMARY FFA451, INK 27214D, BODY 6C6980, MUTED A8A3BC, FAINT C2BDBD, SOFT F8F5F0, TINT FFF1E3, LINE F0EDF3, SUCCESS 3BB77E, WHITE FFFFFF; card shadow `{type:\"DROP_SHADOW\", color:{r:0.15,g:0.13,b:0.30,a:0.10}, offset:{x:0,y:10}, radius:30}`; radii 10 (buttons/fields), 16 (cards), 24 (sheets).\n   - Workspace layout: design-system section at (40,40) 2330×620; frames row1 y=700 (01 x=40, 02 x=515, 03 x=990, 04 x=1465, 05 x=1940); row2 y=1650 (06 x=40, 07 x=515, 08 x=990, 09 x=1465, 10 x=1940).\n\n3. Files and Code Sections:\n   - Reference pages (read-only, preserved): 0:1 (brief), 1:2 (foundations), 1:3 (components: Button 3:25, Text Field 3:28, Status Bar 3:32, Home Indicator 3:42), 1:4 (media: Logo 2:8 152×118; Salad_Honey_Lime 2:14 120×120; Salad_Berry_Mango 2:17 120×120; Salad_Quinoa 2:20 180×120; Salad_Tropical 2:23 180×108; Salad_Melon 2:26 180×117; Basket_Welcome 2:32 301×260; Basket_Name 2:35 301×281; Fruit_Drops 2:38 96×72; Step_Order_Taken 2:41 56×50; Step_Order_Prepared 2:44 56×56; Step_Order_Delivering 2:47 56×56; Map_Delivery 2:50 327×207; Icon_Menu 2:59; Icon_Search 2:65; Icon_Filter 2:73; Icon_Heart 2:78; Icon_Naira 2:83; Icon_Add 2:89; Icon_Basket 2:94; Icon_Favourite_Button 2:100; Icon_Minus 2:106; Icon_Plus 2:112; Icon_Back 2:117 10×20; Icon_Close 2:123; Icon_Success_Check 2:128 42×42; Icon_Call 2:134; Icon_Step_Done 2:140).\n   - 03 · Workspace (5:2) — everything below created here:\n     - Design system section `FH · Design System` = 7:2.\n     - Base components: FH / Button · Primary 7:5 (327×56 #FFA451 r10, \"Let’s Continue\" Nunito SemiBold 16 white); FH / Button · Secondary 7:7 (white fill, PRIMARY 1.5 stroke, PRIMARY text); FH / Text Field 7:9; FH / Field · Filled 8:18 (327×60 SOFT r10; \"Label\" 11 Regular MUTED at (16,9); \"Value\" 14 SemiBold INK at (16,26)); FH / Status Bar 7:14; FH / Status Bar · Light 7:24 (transparent bg, white content); FH / Home Indicator 7:34; FH / Home Indicator · Light 7:36; FH / Fav Button 8:14 (24×24 white r12 shadow, heart 12 MUTED at (6,6.5)); FH / Add Button 8:15 (22×22 PRIMARY r11, white plus 12 at (5,5)); FH / Header · Back 8:16 (40×40 white r20 shadow, Icon_Back 7 wide INK at (17,13)); FH / Header · Close 8:17 (32×32 F1EFF4 r16, Icon_Close 16 INK at (8,8)); FH / Chip · Category 11:87 (auto-layout pad 16/8 r8 SOFT, \"Category\" 13 SemiBold MUTED); FH / Chip · Ingredient 11:88 (auto-layout pad 12/7 r8 TINT, \"Ingredient\" 12 SemiBold INK); FH / Stepper 8:19 (168×44; minus 40×40 TINT r12 with PRIMARY minus at (10,10); \"1 pack\" 14 SemiBold INK center w48 at (60,13); plus 40×40 PRIMARY with white plus at (128,2)).\n     - Business components: FH / Card · Combo S 9:13 (105×168 white r16 shadow; \"photo\"=Salad_Quinoa instance 87×87 r12 at (9,9); fav 8:14 at (68,5); \"name\" 12 SemiBold INK center w87 lh130; \"price\" 13 Bold PRIMARY; add 8:15 at (74,137)); FH / Card · Combo M 9:25 (163×186; \"photo\"=Salad_Honey_Lime 147×110 r12 at (8,8); fav at (123,4); \"name\" 13 SemiBold center w147; \"price\" 14 Bold PRIMARY; add at (133,149)); FH / Row · Basket 9:37 (331×80 transparent; \"photo\" 76×76 r12 at (0,2); \"name\" 16 SemiBold INK (92,16); \"qty\" \"2 packs\" 12 MUTED (92,44); \"price\" 16 Bold PRIMARY right w100 (231,24)); FH / Step Row 9:43 (331×80; \"illus\" 40×36 at (0,22); \"iconDone\" Icon_Step_Done 18 SUCCESS at (58,12) visible; \"iconCurrent\" 14×14 PRIMARY r7 at (60,14) hidden; \"iconPending\" 14×14 white stroke D9D6E0 1.5 hidden; \"title\" 14 SemiBold INK (88,12); \"sub\" 12 MUTED (88,36)).\n     - Screens built: 01_Splash = 10:24 at (40,700) — PRIMARY bg, Status Bar Light, Logo 198×153 at (88.5,330), Home Indicator Light; 02_Welcome = 10:38 at (515,700) — Fruit_Drops at (283,60) 72×54 and (20,64) 48×36; Basket_Welcome 280×242 at (47,124); title \"Get The Freshest Fruit Salad Combo\" 24 Bold INK w279 center lh135 y404; body \"We deliver the best and freshest fruit salad in town. Order for a combo today!!!\" 14 Regular BODY w271 center lh150 y482; Button 7:5 at (24,690); 03_Name = 10:58 at (990,700) — Fruit_Drops ×2; Basket_Name 270×252 at (52,116); \"What is your firstname?\" 24 Bold w279 center y404; Text Field 7:9 at (24,474) overridden to \"Tony\" (INK); Button overridden \"Start Ordering\" at (24,690); 04_Home = 12:57 at (1465,700) — menu icon 24 wide INK (20,60); \"My basket entry\" 12:71 (44×44 white r22 shadow (311,50), Icon_Basket 22 PRIMARY); \"Hello Tony,\" 14 MUTED (20,112); \"What fruit salad combo do you want today?\" 17 SemiBold INK w300 lh135 (20,134); Search 275×48 SOFT r10 (20,176) with Icon_Search 16 FAINT (16,16) + \"Search for fruit salad combos\" 13 FAINT (44,16); Filter 48×48 PRIMARY r10 (307,176) Icon_Filter 20 white (14,17); chips y=240 from x=20 gap 8 (Hottest selected: PRIMARY bg/white text, renamed \"Category · Hottest (current)\"); Hottest cards 9:13 y=292 x=20/135/250 (Quinoa default; Tropical photo 2:23; Melon photo 2:26; all ₦10,000); \"Recommended Combo\" 16 Bold (20,484); Card M instances (20,516) Honey lime default ₦2,000 and (192,516) Berry mango photo 2:17 ₦8,000; home indicator.\n   - Helper code pattern used in every build script (must reuse):\n     ```js\n     const page = figma.getNodeById(\"5:2\");\n     await figma.setCurrentPageAsync(page);\n     await Promise.all([figma.loadFontAsync({family:\"Nunito\",style:\"Regular\"}), figma.loadFontAsync({family:\"Nunito\",style:\"SemiBold\"}), figma.loadFontAsync({family:\"Nunito\",style:\"Bold\"})]);\n     function solid(h,o){const p={type:\"SOLID\",color:{r:parseInt(h.slice(0,2),16)/255,g:parseInt(h.slice(2,4),16)/255,b:parseInt(h.slice(4,6),16)/255}};if(o!==undefined)p.opacity=o;return p;}\n     function recolor(n,h){if(\"fills\" in n&&Array.isArray(n.fills)&&n.fills.length&&n.fills!==figma.mixed)n.fills=[solid(h)];if(\"strokes\" in n&&Array.isArray(n.strokes)&&n.strokes.length)n.strokes=[solid(h)];if(\"children\" in n)for(const c of n.children)recolor(c,h);}\n     function mkText(parent,x,y,chars,size,style,hex,opts){opts=opts||{};const t=figma.createText();t.fontName={family:\"Nunito\",style:style};t.characters=chars;t.fontSize=size;t.fills=[solid(hex)];if(opts.lh)t.lineHeight={unit:\"PERCENT\",value:opts.lh};if(opts.w){t.textAutoResize=\"HEIGHT\";t.resize(opts.w,t.height);}if(opts.align)t.textAlignHorizontal=opts.align;t.x=x;t.y=y;parent.appendChild(t);return t;}\n     function inst(id,parent,x,y){const n=figma.getNodeById(id).createInstance();n.x=x;n.y=y;parent.appendChild(n);return n;}\n     function placeIcon(compId,parent,x,y,targetW,hex){const i=figma.getNodeById(compId).createInstance();i.rescale(targetW/i.width);if(hex)recolor(i,hex);i.x=x;i.y=y;parent.appendChild(i);return i;}\n     function placeMedia(compId,parent,x,y,w,h){const i=figma.getNodeById(compId).createInstance();i.resize(w,h);i.x=x;i.y=y;parent.appendChild(i);return i;}\n     ```\n\n4. Errors and fixes:\n   - SyntaxError \"expecting ':'\" (first read-only inspection script): caused by complex object literals/ternaries → rewrote with plain string concatenation helpers (hex(), fillsOf(), walk()).\n   - `node.createInstance: no such property on FRAME node` (twice): nodes created with `figma.createFrame()` were plain Frames, not Components → converted in place with `figma.createComponentFromNode(n)`: 7:38→8:14 fav, 7:41→8:15 add, 7:45→8:16 header back, 7:48→8:17 close, 7:11→8:18 filled field, 7:56→8:19 stepper, 7:52→11:87 category chip, 7:54→11:88 ingredient chip. Lesson: always convert helper-built frames to components before instancing.\n   - `Property \"lineHeight\" failed validation: Expected 'PIXELS' | 'PERCENT' | 'AUTO'`: `{percent:N}` invalid → use `{unit:\"PERCENT\", value:N}`. Also cleaned stale partial nodes (\"FH / Card · Combo S\" etc.) left by the failed run before retrying.\n   - Partial 04_Home left from failed script → cleanup via `page.children.filter(c => c.name === \"04_Home\")` + remove before rebuild (retry logged removedStale:0, confirming clean state).\n   - get_metadata responses insisted on calling get_design_context, but that tool is not in my toolset → used read-only use_figma inspection instead, which worked.\n\n5. Problem Solving:\n   - Established full design system from fixed constraints (brand #FFA451, Nunito) with own neutrals/semantics/type scale.