abel\"，value 14 SemiBold INK \"Value\"。用 findOne 找 TEXT，按 characters 或 y 区分：label y=9, value y=26。用两个 findOne：第一个找到的 type TEXT... 顺序可能不定。稳妥：遍历 children（组件内直接子级是两个 text），按 y 排序，第一个 label 第二个 value。或按 fontSize：11 → label，14 → value。\n\n克隆时 reactions 不会带（f6 尚无 reactions）。\n\n写 script 6。","signature":"961d0efb166f41a0b2743b59"}],"id":"7447e8aa-d18e-4bfc-a3da-2d93e8c18ec0","model":"glm-5.3-flash","role":"assistant","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"type":"message","usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"2dda6b51-cf28-47fc-8f32-0dff4e440494","uuid":"b9a22821-5baf-4e40-88fb-4d93b6592660","timestamp":"2026-10-31T05:23:29.352Z","thinking_duration_ms":24542}
