{"type":"assistant","message":{"content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"07/08 完成。现在建 09_Order_Complete (1465,1650) 和 10_Track_Order (1940,1650)。\n\n09:\n- white bg, status bar, home indicator\n- Icon_Success_Check 2:128 (42×42) rescale 至 90 → scale 90/42 ≈ 2.143 → rescale(2.143)，x=142.5, y=196\n- \"Congratulations!!!\" 24 Bold INK centered w375 y=320\n- \"Your order has been taken and is being attended to\" 14 Regular BODY w279 center x=48 y=368, lh 160\n- \"Track order\" primary 327×56 at (24, 690)... 但 09 也要 \"Continue shopping\" secondary。布局：Track order y=646, Continue shopping y=710? 812-710-56=46。或 Track order y=630, continue y=694。home indicator 778 会和 continue 重叠 (694+56=750 < 778 OK)。用 Track order (24, 622), Continue shopping (24, 690)。home indicator 778。\n\n10:\n- white bg, status bar\n- back 8:16 (20,52) name \"Go back\"\n- \"Delivery Status\" 18 Bold center w375 y=62\n- call btn: frame 40×40 PRIMARY r20 at (315,52), Icon_Call white 18 rescale inside (原 2:134 尺寸未知，rescale to 18 wide, recolor white, center: x=(40-w)/2)。做: instance rescale(18/width)，再 x=(40-i.width)/2, y=(40-i.height)/2。\n- Map_Delivery 2:50 → instance resize 327×207 at (24,116)，cornerRadius 16 + clipsContent？instance 的 cornerRadius 可设。\n- 4 step rows (9:43) at x=22, y=347/429/511/593, 331 宽：\n  - Row1 \"Order Taken\": illus 2:41 (默认), iconDone visible, iconCurrent hidden, iconPending hidden, title \"Order Taken\", sub \"Order taken by delivery agent\"? 文案未严格规定 sub。summary 里 sub 未定，我自己定合理文案：\n    - Order Taken — sub \"Your order has been received\"\n    - Order Is Being Prepared — sub \"Preparing your fresh fruit salad\"... 但插图组件 illus 默认 2:41? Step Row 组件默认 illus 是哪个图？组件 9:43 用 2:41 作为默认。行1: 2:41; 行2: 2:44; 行3: 2:47。\n  - Row2 \"Order Is Being Prepared\": illus 2:44, done 状态: iconDone visible\n  - Row3 \"Order Is Being Delivered\" (current): illus 2:47, iconCurrent visible (PRIMARY dot), title PRIMARY 色, sub \"Your delivery agent is coming\"\n  - Row4 \"Order Received\" (pending): illus? 无第四插图（只有3个 step 插图 + Fruit_Drops 96×72）。pending 行可用 iconPending 显示、illus 保持 2:47？不好。第4行可以不用插图 —— 将 illus 设为空/隐藏？或用 iconPending 在 illus 位置。我决定: 行4 illus 隐藏 (visible=false)，marker 用 iconPending，title MUTED，sub \"Your order will be received soon\"。但 illus 隐藏后行会显得空。另一方案：第4行 illus 位置放一个 40×36 空槽。就隐藏吧，或者用 Fruit_Drops 缩到 40×30？Fruit_Drops 是装饰水果图，语义不合。就隐藏。\n  \n  Step Row 组件结构：illus (40×36) at (0,22), iconDone at (58,12) 18px, iconCurrent at (60,14) 14 r7 PRIMARY, iconPending at (60,14)? summary 说 iconCurrent (60,14), iconPending 未给坐标 (14×14 white stroke D9D6E0)。假设同位置。连接线 x≈64 在 marker 之间 y 从 row_i marker 中心到下一行 marker 中心。marker 在行内 y=14..28（中心 21 相对行顶），行 y=347 → marker 中心 y=368；行距 82 → 线段从 y=372 到 y=446 之类。画线：rect w2 x=64, 从 (rowY+32) 到 (rowY+82-4)：即高 82-36=46。done 段（行1→2, 2→3）PRIMARY，行3→4 段 #D9D6E0。\n  \n  但 done marker (iconDone) 在 y=12..30 中心 21；current dot y=14..28 中心 21。线从 y=rowY+34 到 nextRowY+8? 简化：segment rect y = rowY + 36, height = 82 - 36 - 8 = 38。x=64 w=2。行3 的 marker 中心也一样。\n\n  overrides: title/sub 字符串；title 颜色：row3 PRIMARY, row4 MUTED, rows1-2 默认 INK。iconDone visibility：rows1-2 true, row3 false, row4 false。iconCurrent: row3 true else false。iconPending: row4 true else false。illus 图片 swaps for rows 2,3；row4 illus visible=false。\n\n- home indicator。\n\n按钮命名：Track order → name \"Track order\"，Continue shopping 实例按钮 name 改。\n\n然后 script 7 做原型 wiring。这个 script 先建 09/10。","signature":"a17505ec818f491f8e2789fc"}],"id":"9503d589-fdf3-4f91-b0f9-48167dcdc703","model":"glm-5.3-flash","role":"assistant","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"type":"message","usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"2dda6b51-cf28-47fc-8f32-0dff4e440494","uuid":"ff4edb17-0ec7-4163-9e30-7ab4bcc197b6","timestamp":"2026-10-31T05:24:26.980Z","thinking_duration_ms":30572}
