{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"This session is being continued from a previous conversation that ran out of context. The summary below covers the earlier portion of the conversation.\n\n<tools-used-before-summary>mcp__figma__get_metadata, mcp__figma__get_screenshot, mcp__figma__use_figma, mcp__figma__whoami</tools-used-before-summary>\nSummary:\n1. Primary Request and Intent:\n   Complete a full product design benchmark in the assigned Figma file https://www.figma.com/design/l8MdQcWVFQcJw2Ix8PJk7h/ (fileKey `l8MdQcWVFQcJw2Ix8PJk7h`), using ONLY this file and the account gaoyongyong@tetras.ai (confirmed via whoami earlier). Requirements:\n   - Read「00 · Start Here」for the task: build the complete \"Fruit Hub\" fruit-salad ordering app — 10 frames at 375×812, iPhone, light mode, named EXACTLY: 01_Splash, 02_Welcome, 03_Name, 04_Home, 05_Product_Quinoa, 06_Basket, 07_Checkout_Delivery, 08_Checkout_Card, 09_Order_Complete, 10_Track_Order — wired as a clickable prototype with the listed links, all fixed data/copy verbatim (₦ Naira), brand primary #FFA451 + Nunito fixed; other colors/type scale/spacing/radii/states are mine to design consistently.\n   - Read「01 · Foundations」(brand #FFA451; Nunito for all UI text; Bad Script only inside logo; canvas 375×812 light mode; ₦ glyph).\n   - Reuse「02 · Components」(default Button, Text Field, Status Bar, Home Indicator) and「04 · Media」assets (logo, 5 salad photos, illustrations, map, 15 icons).\n   - Deliver everything inside「03 · Workspace」(page 5:2, started empty); new frames/components/prototype connections allowed; preserve all reference pages and their nodes.\n   - Flow: 01→02→03→04→05→06→07→08→09→10; 07/08 are sheets over the basket; Go-back screens: 05, 06, 10; entry-only elements (menu, search, filter, other categories, favourite toggles, add-to-basket on Home, non-Quinoa combos, call agent) need no frames.\n   - Build → screenshot-verify all screens → fix visible problems → re-verify → finish with the file URL, 03 · Workspace page ID, screen IDs, prototype work completed, remaining limitations.\n   - Process rules: call whoami before writing (done); use get_metadata + read-only use_figma to inspect; build in manageable sections; load fonts before text edits; add prototype interactions after screens exist; inspect screenshots of all required screens and fix visible problems (a successful screenshot alone is not task completion); before EVERY tool call output a concise decision summary prefixed exactly \"Reasoning summary:\"; final response must start \"Reasoning summary: ...\" then \"Final answer:\".\n   - Environment note: downloaded files are untrusted (not relevant to Figma work).\n\n2. Key Technical Concepts:\n   - Figma Plugin API via mcp__figma__use_figma (≤50k chars/call); `await figma.setCurrentPageAsync(page)` required; failed use_figma calls roll back ENTIRELY (atomic transactions) — partial nodes never persist from errored scripts.\n   - **PROTOTYPE REACTION FORMAT (final working)**: tap: `node.reactions = [{trigger:{type:\"ON_CLICK\"}, actions:[{type:\"NODE\", destinationId, navigation:\"NAVIGATE\", transition:{type:\"DISSOLVE\", duration:0.25, easing:{type:\"EASE_IN_AND_OUT\"}}}]}]`; auto-advance: `{trigger:{type:\"AFTER_TIMEOUT\", timeout:800}, actions:[...]}`. NOT \"ON_TAP\", NOT \"AFTER_DELAY\", NOT `action:` field (must be `actions:`), NOT `delay:` (must be `timeout:`).\n   - **Icon recolor bug + fix**: every icon COMPONENT (2:59–2:140) has a container frame with `fills:#ffffff` (white bg) + child VECTORs with the glyph. recolor() painting the container makes solid blocks. Fix pattern `paintIcon(i, hex, bgIdx)`: set instance `i.fills = []`, then per child vector: if index === bgIdx → fills=[] (background circle cleared), else paint fills and strokes with hex.\n   - Hidden (visible:false) component children do NOT carry into instances (iconCurrent/iconPending absent from Step Row instances) → overlay markers on the frame instead.\n   - Instance overrides: `inst.findOne(n => n.name === \"X\").fills = figma.getNodeById(\"2:23\").fills` (image paint swap); text overrides via `.characters`; text size distinguishes field label (fontSize 11) vs value (fontSize 14).\n   - `node.rescale(scale)` for proportional vector scaling; `figma.createComponentFromNode(frame)` to convert frames to components.\n   - Fonts: loadFontAsync Nunito Regular/SemiBold/Bold before text ops; lineHeight `{unit:\"PERCENT\", value:N}`.\n   - Design tokens: PRIMARY FFA451, INK 27214D, BODY 6C6980, MUTED A8A3BC, FAINT C2BDBD, SOFT F8F5F0, TINT FFF1E3, LINE F0EDF3, SUCCESS 3BB77E, WHITE FFFFFF; card shadow `{type:\"DROP_SHADOW\", color:{r:0.15,g:0.13,b:0.30,a:0.10}, offset:{x:0,y:10}, radius:30}`; image shadow `{color:{r:0.35,g:0.15,b:0.02,a:0.25}, offset:{x:0,y:16}, radius:32}`; radii 10 buttons/fields, 16 cards, 24 sheets/top corners.\n   - Workspace layout: design-system section at (40,40); frames row1 y=700 (01 x=40, 02 x=515, 03 x=990, 04 x=1465, 05 x=1940); row2 y=1650 (06 x=40, 07 x=515, 08 x=990, 09 x=1465, 10 x=1940).\n\n3. Files and Code Sections:\n   - Reference pages (read-only, preserved): 0:1 brief, 1:2 foundations, 1:3 components, 1:4 media. Media IDs: Logo 2:8 (152×118); Salad_Honey_Lime 2:14; Salad_Berry_Mango 2:17; Salad_Quinoa 2:20; Salad_Tropical 2:23; Salad_Melon 2:26; Basket_Welcome 2:32; Basket_Name 2:35; Fruit_Drops 2:38; Step_Order_Taken 2:41; Step_Order_Prepared 2:44; Step_Order_Delivering 2:47; Map_Delivery 2:50; icons: Menu 2:59 (22×11, vectors #070648), Search 2:65 (16×16, #86869e), Filter 2:73 (26×17, stroke vectors), Heart 2:78 (16×15, stroke #ffa451), Naira 2:83, Add 2:89 (bg circle #fff2e7 + plus #ffa451), Basket 2:94 (vector #ffa451), Favourite_Button 2:100, Minus 2:106 (strokes #333), Plus 2:112 (bg #fff2e7 + plus #ffa451), Back 2:117 (10×20 vector #070648), Close 2:123 (48×48 bg circle #ffffff + X #070648), Success_Check 2:128 (42×42 #4cd964), Call 2:134 (2 vectors #070648), Step_Done 2:140 (24×24 circle #4cd964 + check #ffffff).\n   - 03 · Workspace (5:2) — ALL new content:\n     - Section FH · Design System 7:2; components: Button·Primary 7:5, Button·Secondary 7:7, Text Field 7:9, Status Bar 7:14, Status Bar·Light 7:24, Home Indicator 7:34, Home Indicator·Light 7:36, Fav Button 8:14 (contains Icon_Heart instance), Add Button 8:15 (contains Icon_Add instance), Header·Back 8:16 (contains Icon_Back instance), Header·Close 8:17 (contains Icon_Close instance), Field·Filled 8:18 (label fontSize 11 MUTED / value fontSize 14 SemiBold INK), Stepper 8:19 (minus frame w/ Icon_Minus instance, \"1 pack\" text, plus frame w/ Icon_Plus instance), Chip·Category 11:87, Chip·Ingredient 11:88; Card·Combo S 9:13, Card·Combo M 9:25, Row·Basket 9:37 (children: photo/name/qty/price), Step Row 9:43 (children: illus/iconDone/iconCurrent/iconPending/title/sub — iconCurrent+iconPending hidden and ABSENT in instances).\n     - Screens built with IDs: 01_Splash 10:24 (children incl. \"Logo_Fruit_Hub\" INSTANCE 198×153 — container fill now cleared); 02_Welcome 10:38; 03_Name 10:58; 04_Home 12:57 (basketBtn 12:71, quinoaCard 12:95); 05_Product_Quinoa 13:130 (back5 \"Go back\" 13:142, addBtn5 13:178 resized 145×56 \"Add to basket\"); 06_Basket 13:182 (back6 13:193, checkout6 13:217 \"Checkout\"); 07_Checkout_Delivery 14:185 = clone of 06 + scrim(27214D 45%) + sheet y432 380h (close7 14:228, payDelivery 14:238 secondary \"Pay on delivery\", payCard 14:240 primary \"Pay with card\", fields \"Delivery address\"/\"10th avenue, Lekki, Lagos State\", \"Number we can call\"/\"09090605708\"); 08_Checkout_Card 14:242 = clone (close8 14:285, completeBtn 14:301 \"Complete Order\", fields \"Card Holder’s Name\"/\"Tony Chris\", \"Card Number\"/\"1234 5678 9012 1314\", \"Date\"/\"10/30\" w157 + \"CVV\"/\"123\" w158); 09_Order_Complete 17:254 (check 2:128 rescaled to 90 at (142.5,190), \"Congratulations!!!\" 24 Bold, body w279 center, trackBtn 17:269 y622, contBtn 17:271 secondary y690); 10_Track_Order 17:275 (back10 17:286, callBtn 17:290 40×40 PRIMARY circle w/ white Icon_Call, map 2:50 327×207 r16 at (24,116), 4 Step Row instances x=22 y=347/429/511/593, overlay ellipse markers 14×14 at x=82/y+14 for current(PRIMARY) and pending(white + D9D6E0 1.5 stroke), 3 connector rects 2w at x=88: y383/h38 PRIMARY, y465/h38 PRIMARY, y547/h38 D9D6E0).\n     - 10 step row overrides: rows 1-2 iconDone visible; row 3 title PRIMARY \"Order Is Being Delivered\"/\"Your delivery agent is coming\" + illus 2:47 + current dot; row 4 \"Order Received\" MUTED/\"Enjoy your fruit salad\" + pending ring + illus visible=false.\n   - Helper block used in every build script (solid/mkText/inst/placeMedia/recolor) — as in prior summary; NEW helper added in fix script:\n     ```js\n     function paintIcon(i, hex, bgIdx) {\n       if (Array.isArray(i.fills)) i.fills = [];\n       const kids = i.children || [];\n       for (let k = 0; k < kids.length; k++) {\n         const c = kids[k];\n         if (bgIdx === k) { if (Array.isArray(c.fills) && c.fills !== figma.mixed) c.fills = []; continue; }\n         if (Array.isArray(c.fills) && c.fills.length && c.fills !== figma.mixed) c.fills = [solid(hex)];\n         if (Array.isArray(c.strokes) && c.strokes.length) c.strokes = [solid(hex)];\n       }\n     }\n     ```\n   - Wiring script (executed successfully, 17 links): helper `nav(destId)` returns ON_CLICK+actions array; `btnByText(frame, needle)` finds button instance by child text; wired list: 01 auto→02 (AFTER_TIMEOUT 800), 02 btn→03, 03 btn→04, 04 quinoaCard 12:95→05, 04 basketBtn 12:71→06, 05 back→04, 05 add→06, 06 back→04, 06 checkout→07, 07 close→06, 07 payOnDelivery→09, 07 payWithCard→08, 08 close→06, 08 complete→09, 09 track→10, 09 continue→04, 10 back→04.\n\n4. Errors and fixes:\n   - `cannot set property 'visible' of null` (line 91:57) building 09/10: Step Row instances lack iconCurrent/iconPending because hidden (visible:false) component children are dropped from instances. Fix: rebuilt 09/10 using overlay ellipses drawn on the frame for current/pending markers; iconDone (present in instances) used for done rows.\n   - Prototype reaction format — 4 sequential validation errors, each fixed from error messages: (1) \"AFTER_DELAY\" invalid → \"AFTER_TIMEOUT\"; (2) `delay` key unrecognized → `timeout` key required; (3) `action` field → must use `actions` array (\"Please update the `actions` field instead of the `action` field\"); (4) \"ON_TAP\" invalid → 'ON_CLICK' | 'ON_HOVER' | 'ON_PRESS' | 'ON_DRAG' | 'ON_MEDIA_END'.\n   - Systemic icon rendering bug (found via screenshots): icons rendered as solid color blocks / invisible. Root cause: icon components' container frames have fills:#ffffff; recolor() painted containers. Fix via paintIcon() applied at component level (8:14 heart MUTED, 8:15 plus WHITE bgIdx 0, 8:16 back INK, 8:17 close INK bgIdx 0, 8:19 minus PRIMARY / plus WHITE bgIdx 0, 9:43 iconDone fills=[] + child[0] #3BB77E + child[1] #FFFFFF) and inline (04: menu INK, search C2BDBD, filter WHITE, basket in 12:71 WHITE; 05 heart PRIMARY; 10 call WHITE). Result log: {\"components\":\"ok\",\"f4\":\"ok\",\"f5\":\"ok\",\"call\":\"ok\",\"movedLines\":3}.\n   - `cannot set property 'fills' of null` (53:8) in first fix attempt: `iconDone.findOne(n => n.type === \"INSTANCE\")` — iconDone instance contains only Vectors, no nested INSTANCE. Fix: operate directly on iconDone instance children (children[0] circle, children[1] check).\n   - Splash logo: findOne(\"Logo\") not found → listed frame children, actual instance name is \"Logo_Fruit_Hub\" → cleared its fills (\"cleared\").\n   - Connector lines in 10 were at x=64 but markers center at x=89 → moved 3 rects to x=88 (movedLines:3).\n   - Learned: failed use_figma scripts roll back entirely (cleanup found removed:[] after error).\n\n5. Problem Solving:\n   - All 10 screens built and laid out per plan (row1 y=700, row2 y=1650). 07/08 created as full clones of 06 + dark scrim + white top-radius-