 you are looking for a new fruit salad to eat today, quinoa is the perfect brunch for you.” / • Media: Salad_Quinoa / • Quantity: 1 pack, can be decreased / increased · price ₦10,000'\ny=1690 sz=11 'LINKS'\ny=1717 sz=14 '→ Go back → 04_Home / → Add to basket → 06_Basket'\ny=1438 sz=18 '06_Basket'\ny=1475 sz=14 'Goal: Review the basket and check out.'\ny=1506 sz=11 'MUST INCLUDE'\ny=1533 sz=14 '• Actions: Go back · Checkout / • Copy: “My Basket” / • Items: Quinoa fruit salad · Melon fruit salad · Tropical fruit salad, each with photo, name, “2 packs” and ₦20,000 / • Total: “Total” ₦60,000'\ny=1648 sz=11 'LINKS'\ny=1675 sz=14 '→ Go back → 04_Home / → Checkout → 07_Checkout_Delivery'\ny=1833 sz=18 '07_Checkout_Delivery'\ny=1870 sz=14 'Goal: Give delivery details and choose how to pay.'\ny=1901 sz=11 'MUST INCLUDE'\ny=1928 sz=14 '• Actions: close · Pay on delivery · Pay with card / • Delivery: “Delivery address” 10th avenue, Lekki, Lagos State · “Number we can call” 09090605708 · both filled in / • Presentation: opens over 06_Basket; the basket stays behind it'\ny=2022 sz=11 'LINKS'\ny=2049 sz=14 '→ close → 06_Basket / → Pay with card → 08_Checkout_Card / → Pay on delivery → 09_Order_Complete'\ny=1833 sz=18 '08_Checkout_Card'\ny=1870 sz=14 'Goal: Pay by card.'\ny=1901 sz=11 'MUST INCLUDE'\ny=1928 sz=14 '• Actions: close · Complete Order / • Card: “Card Holder’s Name” Tony Chris · “Card Number” 1234 5678 9012 1314 · “Date” 10/30 · “CVV” 123 · all filled in / • Presentation: opens over 06_Basket; the basket stays behind it'\ny=2022 sz=11 'LINKS'\ny=2049 sz=14 '→ close → 06_Basket / → Complete Order → 09_Order_Complete'\ny=2186 sz=18 '09_Order_Complete'\ny=2223 sz=14 'Goal: Confirm the order was placed.'\ny=2254 sz=11 'MUST INCLUDE'\ny=2281 sz=14 '• Actions: Track order · Continue shopping / • Copy: “Congratulations!!!” · “Your order has been taken and is being attended to” / • Status: success mark (Icon_Success_Check)'\ny=2354 sz=11 'LINKS'\ny=2381 sz=14 '→ Track order → 