erarchy / 5. Visual quality & consistency of your own system / 6. Component reuse / 7. State design (current category, filled fields, sheet over basket, done / current / pending steps)'\ny=4024 sz=15 'Deliverable: the link to your own Figma file containing the 10 named frames, your components and the prototype.'\n\n=== MEDIA MAP ===\n2:8 COMPONENT 'Logo_Fruit_Hub' 152x118 IMG hash=ce01ba875d4c35e8b300266d3cf8adfabef4a4f0\n2:14 COMPONENT 'Salad_Honey_Lime' 120x120 IMG hash=ee16823da03b881bf4ce051b2a64b06284deadd7\n2:17 COMPONENT 'Salad_Berry_Mango' 120x120 IMG hash=b585f503dd236cf04a42d95381c96cc2b592320b\n2:20 COMPONENT 'Salad_Quinoa' 180x120 IMG hash=f3964b02293c08dbccc8996d32beb6f05e420119\n2:23 COMPONENT 'Salad_Tropical' 180x108 IMG hash=c1bfb8f7a2aeef0262bb51afeaba8405f6cb35ea\n2:26 COMPONENT 'Salad_Melon' 180x117 IMG hash=1965b0539f8fb0fc8a196f5bb8c07809cbbd3e78\n2:32 COMPONENT 'Basket_Welcome' 301x260 IMG hash=edcf8e89db5451b875a74a87c96f0f40d451c9df\n2:35 COMPONENT 'Basket_Name' 301x281 IMG hash=70de1d2b47c6f7b970c55f11642487012e865efb\n2:38 COMPONENT 'Fruit_Drops' 96x72 IMG hash=c029d1f803ecf635da2ca3a0400474d8a7225959\n2:41 COMPONENT 'Step_Order_Taken' 56x50 IMG hash=6a31d1ee829d3bd571108902b4fb13ff34fea447\n2:44 COMPONENT 'Step_Order_Prepared' 56x56 IMG hash=663f0e43e96715f132d2e3de1c49591a91e4538d\n2:47 COMPONENT 'Step_Order_Delivering' 56x56 IMG hash=aba6d9136396337b8b1e79a40eb5e0eb2658be4c\n2:50 COMPONENT 'Map_Delivery' 327x207 IMG hash=1e1a485fb097de78f5a14d3b3639cec71689da9f\n"}]}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"2dda6b51-cf28-47fc-8f32-0dff4e440494","uuid":"019d5344-469e-472b-92e6-090652273824","timestamp":"2026-10-31T05:43:58.470Z","tool_use_result":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"=== BRIEF TEXTS ===\ny=64 sz=13 'LEVEL L2 · DESIGN TASK · v2'\ny=96 sz=36 'Fruit Hub — fruit salad ordering app'\ny=162 sz=17 'Design the complete Fruit Hub mobile app: Tony tells the app their first name, browses fruit salad combos, adds one to the basket, checks out with delivery details or a card, and tracks the delivery. / Canvas 375 × 812, iPhone, light mode. Work in your own new Figma file — this file is read-only reference.'\ny=288 sz=24 'How to work'\ny=340 sz=15 '1. Build exactly the 10 frames below, named exactly as listed (one state per frame), and wire them as a clickable prototype with the listed links. / 2. Everything in “Must include” must appear on that frame. The lists are grouped by subject and sorted alphabetically — they are not in screen order and say nothing about layout, grouping, emphasis or styling. Those are your decisions. / 3. The brand primary color and the typeface in 01 · Foundations are fixed. Define every other color yourself (neutrals, text, surfaces, success / error / warning / disabled, supporting colors), plus type scale, spacing, radii and elevation, and apply them consistently. / 4. 02 · Components gives only a default Button, a default Text Field and the platform shell (status bar, home indicator). Design all other states, the headers, the sheets and every business component as reusable components in your file. / 5. Use the logo, product photos, illustrations, map and icons from 04 · Media. Prices use the Naira glyph (Icon_Naira or “₦”). / 6. Copy and data must match “Fixed data” exactly. This brief wins over anything you may know of the original kit.'\ny=595 sz=24 'Frames · goals · must include · links'\ny=647 sz=15 'Frame names are fixed. Must-include lists are grouped by subject and sorted A–Z: they state what is on the screen, never where it goes or how it looks.'\ny=711 sz=18 '01_Splash'\ny=748 sz=14 'Goal: Brand recognition while the app loads.'\ny=779 sz=11 'MUST INCLUDE'\ny=806 sz=14 '• Brand: Logo_Fruit_Hub'\ny=837 sz=11 'LINKS'\ny=864 sz=14 '→ auto → 02_Welcome'\ny=711 sz=18 '02_Welcome'\ny=748 sz=14 'Goal: Explain the offer and start.'\ny=779 sz=11 'MUST INCLUDE'\ny=806 sz=14 '• Actions: Let’s Continue / • Copy: “Get The Freshest Fruit Salad Combo” · “We deliver the best and freshest fruit salad in town. Order for a combo today!!!” / • Media: Basket_Welcome · Fruit_Drops'\ny=900 sz=11 'LINKS'\ny=927 sz=14 '→ Let’s Continue → 03_Name'\ny=1022 sz=18 '03_Name'\ny=1059 sz=14 'Goal: Tell the app your first name.'\ny=1090 sz=11 'MUST INCLUDE'\ny=1117 sz=14 '• Actions: Start Ordering / • Copy: “What is your firstname?” / • Form: first name, entered “Tony” / • Media: Basket_Name · Fruit_Drops'\ny=1211 sz=11 'LINKS'\ny=1238 sz=14 '→ Start Ordering → 04_Home'\ny=1022 sz=18 '04_Home'\ny=1059 sz=14 'Goal: Find a fruit salad combo.'\ny=1090 sz=11 'MUST INCLUDE'\ny=1117 sz=14 '• Account: “Hello Tony, What fruit salad combo do you want today?” · menu entry · My basket entry / • Categories: Hottest / Popular / New combo / Top · current: Hottest / • Hottest: Quinoa fruit salad · Tropical fruit salad · Melon fruit salad, each with photo, name, price, favourite toggle and add to basket / • Recommended: “Recommended Combo” · Honey lime combo · Berry mango combo, each with photo, name, price, favourite toggle and add to basket / • Search & filter: search “Search for fruit salad combos” · filter entry'\ny=1295 sz=11 'LINKS'\ny=1322 sz=14 '→ Quinoa fruit salad → 05_Product_Quinoa / → My basket → 06_Basket'\ny=1438 sz=18 '05_Product_Quinoa'\ny=1475 sz=14 'Goal: Choose a quantity and add the combo to the basket.'\ny=1506 sz=11 'MUST INCLUDE'\ny=1533 sz=14 '• Actions: Go back · favourite toggle · Add to basket / • Contents: “One Pack Contains:” · Red Quinoa, Lime, Honey, Blueberries, Strawberries, Mango, Fresh mint. / • Copy: “Quinoa Fruit Salad” · “If you are looking for a new fruit salad to eat today, quinoa is the perfect brunch for you.” / • Media: Salad_Quinoa / • Quantity: 1 pack, can be decreased / increased · price ₦10,000'\ny=1690 sz=11 'LINKS'\ny=1717 sz=14 '→ Go back → 04_Home / → Add to basket → 06_Basket'\ny=1438 sz=18 '06_Basket'\ny=1475 sz=14 'Goal: Review the basket and check out.'\ny=1506 sz=11 'MUST INCLUDE'\ny=1533 sz=14 '• Actions: Go bac