nCurrent' 14x14 @(60,14) PRIMARY HIDDEN (absent in instances), 'iconPending' 14x14 @(60,14) white + #D9D6E0 stroke HIDDEN (absent in instances), 'title' SemiBold 14 @(88,12), 'sub' Regular 12 @(88,36)).\n     - Moved back into 7:2 this session (were stray page children): 8:14 Fav Button (24x24 white r12, Icon_Heart stroke MUTED), 8:15 Add Button (22x22 PRIMARY r11, white plus), 8:16 Header·Back (40x40 white r20, INK chevron), 8:17 Header·Close (32x32 bg #F1EFF4 r16, INK X), 8:19 Stepper (168x44: minus frame 40x40 TINT r12 w/ Icon_Minus PRIMARY, '1 pack' SemiBold 14 @(60,13), plus frame 40x40 PRIMARY r12 w/ Icon_Plus white).\n   - Media components (image fills directly on component): 2:8 Logo 152x118 hash=ce01ba875d4c35e8b300266d3cf8adfabef4a4f0; 2:14 Honey_Lime 120x120 ee16823da03b881bf4ce051b2a64b06284deadd7; 2:17 Berry_Mango 120x120 b585f503dd236cf04a42d95381c96cc2b592320b; 2:20 Quinoa 180x120 f3964b02293c08dbccc8996d32beb6f05e420119; 2:23 Tropical 180x108 c1bfb8f7a2aeef0262bb51afeaba8405f6cb35ea; 2:26 Melon 180x117 1965b0539f8fb0fc8a196f5bb8c07809cbbd3e78; 2:32 Basket_Welcome 301x260 edcf8e89db5451b875a74a87c96f0f40d451c9df; 2:35 Basket_Name 301x281 70de1d2b47c6f7b970c55f11642487012e865efb; 2:38 Fruit_Drops 96x72 c029d1f803ecf635da2ca3a0400474d8a7225959; 2:41 Step_Taken 56x50 6a31d1ee829d3bd571108902b4fb13ff34fea447; 2:44 Step_Prepared 56x56 663f0e43e96715f132d2e3de1c49591a91e4538d; 2:47 Step_Delivering 56x56 aba6d9136396337b8b1e79a40eb5e0eb2658be4c; 2:50 Map_Delivery 327x207 1e1a485fb097de78f5a14d3b3639cec71689da9f. Icons: 2:59 Menu 22x11, 2:65 Search 16x16, 2:73 Filter 26x17, 2:78 Heart 16x15 (stroke), 2:94 Basket, 2:128 Success_Check 42x42, 2:134 Call, etc.\n   - **Verbatim brief copy extracted (must be used exactly)**:\n     - 01_Splash: Brand: Logo_Fruit_Hub; → auto → 02_Welcome.\n     - 02_Welcome: Button \"Let’s Continue\" (default button text); copy \"Get The Freshest Fruit Salad Combo\" · \"We deliver the best and freshest fruit salad in town. Order for 